<title>USA: Star Multi Care Q1 Aug 31 full results.</title>
<headline>Star Multi Care Q1 Aug 31 full results.</headline>
<dateline>HICKSVILLE, N.Y. 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Highlights (Unaudited)</p>
<p>					     For the Three Months Ended</p>
<p>						  8/31/96	   8/31/95</p>
<p> Net revenues			   $12,563,160     $11,613,886</p>
<p> Operating expenses		    11,877,455	11,465,854</p>
<p> Income from operations		   685,705	   148,032</p>
<p>Other Charges</p>
<p>Non-recurring merger transaction</p>
<p>   costs(a)			     (2,808,223)</p>
<p> Interest expense net		    (45,163)	   (7,900)</p>
<p>Net earnings before</p>
<p>   income taxes (loss)		(2,167,681)	   140,132</p>
<p> Income tax (benefit) provision     (889,000)	   108,000</p>
<p> Net earnings (loss)		 ( 1,278,681)	    32,132</p>
<p>Net earnings per share</p>
<p>   of common stock (loss)		  ( .33)		 .01</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p>common shares outstanding-</p>
<p>   fully diluted			  3,832,669	 3,754,443</p>
<p>Note: (a) Represents a one-time charge for acquisition costs, legal fees, and restructuring costs associated with the acquisition of Amserv Healthcare Inc in August of this year.</p>
<p>Note: Full company name is Star Multi Care Services Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
